f128 ulp survey — 200000 samples per function, deterministic SplitMix64 draws
err = |a − v| / 2^max(E − 112, −16494), v the MPFR value at 300 bits and
E its binade exponent (v ∈ [2^E, 2^(E+1))); the floor is binary128's subnormal
ulp.  A correctly rounded lane never exceeds 0.5, which is what the metallic
column checks: it validates the harness, it is not a result.

